WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:07.875
Beatrice hovered nervously in front of the Council of Animals.

2
00:00:07.876 --> 00:00:11.843
She was thinking about the council's warning.

3
00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:17.981
"If the human ambassador makes too many mistakes, we'll have to remove her gift."

4
00:00:17.982 --> 00:00:21.196
"Little bee." The elephant waved her trunk.

5
00:00:21.197 --> 00:00:26.246
"It's time to return to your new human friend, Daisy Dolittle."

6
00:00:26.247 --> 00:00:30.837
"Wait! You said Daisy can't make too many mistakes.

7
00:00:30.838 --> 00:00:34.332
What did you mean by that?" Beatrice asked.

8
00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:37.999
But the magic was already swirling around her.

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.727
"Just keep an eye on Daisy," the elephant said.

10
00:00:41.728 --> 00:00:48.043
The pig nodded. "And whatever you do, don't let her tell any other humans about her gift.

11
00:00:48.044 --> 00:00:53.814
They must not know she can talk to animals!"

12
00:00:53.815 --> 00:01:01.166
Poof! Beatrice was sent away from the rocky beach.

13
00:01:01.167 --> 00:01:20.032
*** "Wow, the fair is crowded this year!" Daisy

14
00:01:20.033 --> 00:01:24.226
said. Kaleem pointed. "Let's check out that game

15
00:01:24.227 --> 00:01:27.832
booth! I want to win a

16
00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:30.182
prize." "In a second," Daisy

17
00:01:30.183 --> 00:01:34.124
said. "Look! The animal shelter brought some

18
00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:36.059
animals. People can adopt

19
00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:41.041
them." Kaleem grinned. "Of course you want to see the animals, Daisy

20
00:01:41.042 --> 00:01:43.689
Dolittle." "Shh!" Daisy glanced

21
00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:47.749
around. Luckily nobody was paying attention to

22
00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:50.968
them. "Don't call me that where people might

23
00:01:50.969 --> 00:01:57.053
hear." "Okay, sorry." Kaleem paused in front of a booth selling

24
00:01:57.054 --> 00:02:01.228
sunglasses. "The town fair always reminds me that it's almost summer

25
00:02:01.229 --> 00:02:06.041
vacation." "Yep! That means more time for our pet-sitting business," Daisy

26
00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:09.457
said. Kaleem grinned. "Except during our beach

27
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:11.587
trip." Daisy smiled back and

28
00:02:11.588 --> 00:02:16.832
nodded. Their families took a fun beach vacation together every

29
00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:23.003
July. Daisy and Kaleem hurried past the bandstand to get to the shelter's booth.

30
00:02:23.004 --> 00:02:27.530
There they petted a friendly dog.

31
00:02:27.531 --> 00:02:32.025
"Hello!" the dog barked at Daisy. "Will you take me home?"

32
00:02:32.026 --> 00:02:36.699
"Sorry, I can't," Daisy whispered into the dog's ear.

33
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.290
"But you're so cute—I bet someone will."

34
00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:44.696
Daisy and Kaleem petted several other dogs.

35
00:02:44.697 --> 00:02:49.355
There were also some cats in cages under a tent.

36
00:02:49.356 --> 00:02:52.874
Suddenly Daisy heard a familiar bark.

37
00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:55.804
"Hi, Daisy! It's me, Scamp!"

38
00:02:55.805 --> 00:02:58.246
A dog on a leash ran toward them.

39
00:02:58.247 --> 00:03:00.666
He was pulling his owner behind him.

40
00:03:00.667 --> 00:03:04.791
"Scamp, wait for me!" Grace said.

41
00:03:04.792 --> 00:03:09.374
"Hi, Grace," Daisy said. "Hi, Scamp."

42
00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:12.457
"Hi, Daisy!" Scamp barked.

43
00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:19.499
"Did you try a corn dog? I did! It was so delicious!"

44
00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:26.319
Daisy just smiled and petted him without answering.

45
00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:31.670
"Why aren't you answering me?" Scamp's ears drooped slightly.

46
00:03:31.671 --> 00:03:37.623
"Oh, I know. It's because Grace doesn't know you can understand what I say, right?

47
00:03:37.624 --> 00:03:40.499
I wish you would tell her the truth."

48
00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:44.416
Just then a bumblebee buzzed into view.

49
00:03:44.417 --> 00:03:49.795
"Don't say that, you silly canine." She buzzed at Scamp.

50
00:03:49.796 --> 00:03:54.063
"Daisy's power is a secret, remember?"

51
00:03:54.064 --> 00:03:56.882
Daisy was relieved to see the bee.

52
00:03:56.883 --> 00:04:01.395
"Beatrice!" she blurted out. "You're finally back!"

53
00:04:01.396 --> 00:04:04.066
"Huh?" Grace looked confused.

54
00:04:04.067 --> 00:04:09.863
"Who are you talking to, Daisy?" She waved her hand.

55
00:04:09.864 --> 00:04:14.246
"Hey, there's a bee! Be careful, Kaleem."

56
00:04:14.247 --> 00:04:19.866
"Um, right. Eek!" Kaleem pretended to be scared.

57
00:04:19.867 --> 00:04:24.416
"Go away, bee. I'm allergic to you!"

58
00:04:24.417 --> 00:04:28.738
Beatrice flew away fast, but Grace still looked confused.

59
00:04:28.739 --> 00:04:33.077
"Uh-oh!" Daisy thought. "How am I going to explain this?"

60
00:04:33.078 --> 00:04:42.008
Bwap! Skreeet! Hwwahh! They were all surprised at the loud sounds!

